                <pb facs="0644" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg548"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs Nicaragua notifies closing Atlantic ports occupied
                    by rebels. If any question affecting American vessels arises consult note to
                    Colombian minister, Foreign Relations, eighty-five, page two fifty-four.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
